      "contextBefore": "An initialized instance of `AVPlayerItem`.",
      "contextAfter": "The value of each key in `automaticallyLoadedAssetKeys` will automatically be loaded by the underlying [`AVAsset`](avasset.md) before the player item achieves the status [`AVPlayerItem.Status.readyToPlay`](avplayeritem/status-swift.enum/readytoplay.md); i.e. when the item is ready to play, the value returned by invoking the [`asset`](avplayeritem/asset.md) property’s [`statusOfValue(forKey:error:)`](avasynchronouskeyvalueloading/statusofvalue(forkey:error:).md) method will be one of the terminal status values, either [`AVKeyValueStatus.loaded`](avkeyvaluestatus/loaded.md), [`AVKeyValueStatus.failed`](avkeyvaluestatus/failed.md), or [`AVKeyValueStatus.cancelled`](avkeyvaluestatus/cancelled.md).",
